---
// PlateauPain — mirrors the reader's inner monologue about being stuck.
---

<section class="section bg-black-2" aria-label="The plateau">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">The Diagnosis</p>

    <h2 class="headline text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
      More reps. More sets. More days a week. And the number <span class="text-blood">won't move.</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-5 text-base text-stone sm:text-lg">
      <p>If grinding harder worked, you'd already be past your plateau. You're not, so it doesn't.</p>
      <p>Stuck at your max isn't about how hard you train. It's about a few specific mistakes in your form and your recovery that bleed reps without you noticing. Most guys never get told what they are.</p>
      <p>That's the whole reason you're stuck. And every one of them is fixable.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
